commit 9568882101bdba9c9608e27dd67da9af91968c5e

C03: a countdown to a clock time and the bare word «tiempo» read the clock; the remaining time is computed by the mind (CLOCK1329)

CLOCK1155/1156 left three literals open. «cuánto falta para las 3 de la tarde» was declared out of scope: effect_intent.countdown_target reads the asked time (hours, minutes, parts of the day, am/pm, noon/midnight) and the request is a system.time read; the composer adds countdown facts (target, remaining hours and minutes, whether it already passed today) computed from the observed clock, instructs the narrator to copy them, and the clock fact check accepts the target and the remaining figures as non-contrary values. «Tiempo»/«tiempo» asked for confirmation with internal vocabulary: the bare word is the clock read.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


